  "captions": [
    {"start_s": 0, "end_s": 9, "text": "三个同伴，修好了一盏旧灯。", "translation": "Three companions repaired an old lamp."},
    {"start_s": 9, "end_s": 18, "text": "微弱的光，照亮了彼此。", "translation": "Its small light reached each of them."},
    {"start_s": 18, "end_s": 27, "text": "他们带着灯，继续上路。", "translation": "They carried the light onward."},
    {"start_s": 27, "end_s": 35, "text": "桥那边，天空忽然开阔。", "translation": "Beyond the bridge, the sky opened."},
    {"start_s": 35, "end_s": 44, "text": "有一瞬间，以为一切都会好起来。", "translation": "For a moment, everything seemed possible."},
    {"start_s": 44, "end_s": 54, "text": "脚下传来一声轻响。", "translation": "A quiet crack came from below."},
    {"start_s": 54, "end_s": 64, "text": "水声渐近，桥在摇晃。", "translation": "The water rose. The bridge began to sway."},
    {"start_s": 64, "end_s": 73, "text": "下一步，踏空了。", "translation": "The next step found only air."},
    {"start_s": 73, "end_s": 84, "text": "一只手，在最后一刻抓住了我们。", "translation": "A hand caught us at the last moment."},
    {"start_s": 84, "end_s": 96, "text": "是朋友。我们终于松了一口气。", "translation": "A friend. At last, we could breathe."},
    {"start_s": 96, "end_s": 108, "text": "他望着水面，迟迟没有开口。", "translation": "He watched the water without a word."},
    {"start_s": 108, "end_s": 119, "text": "巨型机甲的影子，盖住了天空。", "translation": "A giant machine blotted out the sky."},
    {"start_s": 119, "end_s": 133, "text": "我们以为，真正的危机才刚刚开始。", "translation": "We thought the real danger had just begun."},
    {"start_s": 133, "end_s": 144, "text": "驾驶舱打开了。原来，是你。", "translation": "The cockpit opened. It was you."},
    {"start_s": 144, "end_s": 155, "text": "“我答应过女儿，要给她留一盏灯。”", "translation": "I promised my daughter I would leave a light on."},
    {"start_s": 155, "end_s": 164, "text": "可他的旧家，早已沉在水下。", "translation": "But his old home was already underwater."},
    {"start_s": 164, "end_s": 173, "text": "我们想挽留，却找不到一句有用的话。", "translation": "We wanted him to stay. No words could help."},
    {"start_s": 173, "end_s": 180, "text": "于是，把那盏灯递还给他。", "translation": "So we placed the lamp back in his hands."},
    {"start_s": 180, "end_s": 186, "text": "理解之后，仍然只能放手。", "translation": "We understood. We still had to let go."}
  ]
}
